{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202640tbOjvMeR1793700853.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>荃灣石圍角邨有樹枝折斷，擊傷一名48歲女子。</p><p></p><p>涉事大樹位於山坡上，約有20米高，塌下的樹枝長約5米，消防員將現場圍封，並架起雲梯，將有潛在折斷風險的樹枝鋸走。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FALLING-1530.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026p6ikmOvDgQ1793700867.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>事發在中午，警方接報指，一名女子在石圍角邨石荷樓對開巴士站，被高處跌下來的樹枝砸中，頭部受傷，送往瑪嘉烈醫院治理。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FALLING-1530_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202681Z6S1xBDQ1793700887.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>受事故影響，石圍角路部分行車線一度封閉。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T11:21:58.430767+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T10:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T05:38:39.897230+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T11:18:43.171509+00:00","content_hash":"94ef2c93fd5a0b8f8d9cb05ee2d9ab761176b51bba25ac1a9549e80b624a03c8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T11:21:58.430767+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}